  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0-beta.9: Backoffice auth adapted to Umbraco 17's lowercase `token` on UmbOpenApiConfiguration so the Authorization header is correctly populated. Fixed ManifestLocalization import path (now imports from @umbraco-cms/backoffice/localization). Minor TypeScript cleanup: removed deprecated tsconfig baseUrl, added ImportMeta env shim, tightened nested mapping modal undefined guard, dropped unused state. Example TestHost site tightened up — strongly-typed ModelsBuilder views throughout, fixed broken reviews block on product pages, added missing content-specific image rendering on event/recipe/blog/product views. The TestHost project is an example/demo site only and is not part of the distributable NuGet package. Full documentation at https://github.com/EnjoyDigital/Umbraco.Community.Schemeweaver/tree/main/docs",
